<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel says raising pulp prices.</title>
<headline>Portucel says raising pulp prices.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese pulp producer Portucel Industrial said it was raising pulp prices by 20 ecu per tonne to 510 ecu, effective immediately.</p>
</text>
